    {
      "text": "Strumento che danneggia chi ce l’ha a ogni turno.\nPuò attaccarsi a un Pokémon che entra in contatto\ncon chi ce l’ha a causa di un attacco.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "An item to be held by a Pokémon. It damages the\nholder every turn and may latch on to Pokémon\nthat touch the holder.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "持たせると　毎ターン　ダメージを\n受ける。　自分に　ふれてきた\n相手に　くっつくことも　ある。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "携带后，每回合都会受到伤害。\n有时也会附着到\n碰到自己的对手身上。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Daña en cada turno al Pokémon que la lleva. Puede\nadherirse al Pokémon que alcance con su ataque al\nportador.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      }
    }
  ],
